<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 2.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 2.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   92/94     97/99     UNQ    161/165</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  96/98     99/103  173/175  183/185</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Bunker prices firmed on cargo's strength, traders said on Wednesday. Most sellers refused to move offers lower than $97 per tonne for 380-cst supplies, citing strong cargo prices. But a handful of independents crashed below current cargo quotes to attract buyers. Overall sales were average, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
